{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-214633431ebdb25680e842a165377cfe557631bb454d3052","family_id":"KR:006574","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Rules of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act","title_original":"교통ㆍ에너지ㆍ환경세법 시행규칙","kind":"기획재정부령","source_version":"270243","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=270243","source_sha256":"99129fa87198dde7d65113cb7db1fbce6f402e0eebdd4849d79cfbe3f5e1d12e","body_sha256":"c7cbd379e461570408e0756cdfd076fa221dd1e0e2c54101719f791352388c98","article_count":0,"full_text":"■ Enforcement Rules of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act [Attached Form No. 12] <Amended on May 26, 2014>\n\nNotice of Sales of Petroleum Products for Diplomatic Missions\nFor the month of ____ (released in the month of ____)\n\n| Receipt number | Date of receipt | Date of processing | Processing period: Immediate |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| | | | |\n\nSeller\n\n| Name (representative) | Business registration number |\n|---|---|\n| | |\n| Business name (corporate name) | |\n| | |\n| Address (location of head office) | |\n| | |\n| Location of sales place | |\n| | |\n\nManufacturer\n\n| Name (representative) | Business registration number |\n|---|---|\n| | |\n| Business name (corporate name) | |\n| | |\n| Address (location of head office) | |\n| | |\n| Location of manufacturing place | |\n| | |\n\nDetails of Sales\n\n<table>\n<tr><th>Type of petroleum product</th><th>Date of sale</th><th>Quantity</th><th>Unit price</th><th>Amount</th><th>Tax amount to be credited</th><th>Name of diplomatic mission</th><th>Date of issue and serial number of recommendation</th></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</table>\n\nOther matters for reference: __________________________________________________\n\nI give notice of the above sales of petroleum products for diplomatic missions pursuant to Article 20 (2) of the Enforcement Decree of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act.\n\nYear ____ Month ____ Day ____\nSeller: ____________________ (Signature or seal)\n\nTo the Head of the Tax Office\n\nAttachment: Recommendation for the Purchase of Tax-Exempt Petroleum Products.\nFee: None.\n\nProcessing Procedure\n\n| Step | Procedure | Actor printed in the form |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Prepare application | Applicant |\n| 2 | Receive application | Department in charge of taxpayer support |\n| 3 | Investigate and verify | Department in charge of tax-base management |\n| 4 | Decide and implement | |\n\nThe four boxes are connected in sequence by three arrows pointing to the right.\n\n210 mm × 297 mm [White paper, 80 g/m², or medium-grade paper, 80 g/m²]\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_source_review_evidence":[{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_inputs\\389efdda511138000ae8757dda9aa35320a03de9399e08064ec50cebd75f3b7c.ascii.json","sha256":"389efdda511138000ae8757dda9aa35320a03de9399e08064ec50cebd75f3b7c"},"protocol":"WORKC_P04_1526_EXPLICIT_SOURCE_REVIEWED_AUTHOR_INPUT_V1","reviewed_source_units":[{"source_component_text_sha256":"2fb7bd6f40dafc97c3fe591fd13656f131f2d10c77acbae7b6b54b31cab2dfd8","unit_key":"form-001200F"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"9486d42e7f358af6c08656eb99055e7f13534dfab5962c212fce58b39d0b4648","unit_key":"form-001300F"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"0c06f3f3baf90424eaa2e60628d4453c5b40878a07833b921c7c2796a